WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.247
Absolutely.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.719
He's the CEO.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.366
He used the company logo.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.769
He said please.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.189
What about the hundred-dollar refund?

